	(text "DOUT1 (U903): 0.5 A low-side switch for an external load, driven by ESP32 GPIO23"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 12.7 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.54 2.54)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "510e0265-2829-586f-8b7c-ad3904d4e039")
	)
	(text_box "WHAT IT DOES\nDOUT1 switches an external load (relay coil, buzzer, lamp) on and off. The load is wired between a fused +12/24 V supply and\nJ1 pin 10. When GPIO23 is high, U903 connects pin 10 to GND and current flows through the load (0.5 A continuous).\nU902 turns the ESP32's 3.3 V signal into 5 V for U903, whose built-in protection needs at least 4.5 V on its input.\n\nPINS OF THIS MODULE (its block on the top sheet)\nDOUT1_CTRL (in): from ESP32 GPIO23: 1 = output on (active high)\nDOUT1 (out): open-drain output to J1 pin 10 (Vehicle net class: 0.8 mm clearance)\n+5V (in): the board's 5 V rail (U902 supply)\nGND: ground; the load current returns through J1 pins 1 and 2\nPower and ground reach the parts on this sheet only through these pins: the ground and supply symbols drawn on this sheet are local to it."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 17.78 0)
		(size 265 26.55)
		(margins 1.5 1.5 1.5 1.5)
		(stroke
			(width 0.1524)
			(type solid)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "dbcc54fb-2d3f-5a79-a9e5-3a7e5dfc35a1")
	)
	(rectangle
		(start 93.98 81.28)
		(end 142.24 132.08)
		(stroke
			(width 0.1524)
			(type dash)
			(color 200 60 0 1)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(uuid "2dc90874-f6bf-579c-b0ed-c9cde84d2b7e")
	)
	(text "keep together on the PCB"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 94.58 81.88 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.0 1.0)
				(color 200 60 0 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "560e2e6a-d7f5-5722-bc62-f9cfe0dec7a5")
	)
	(text "C904 belongs to U902 pin 5 (VCC): within 2 mm, GND via beside its GND pad.\nU903: SOURCE (pin 3 and the tab, pin 4) to GND with wide copper and several vias;\nthe DOUT1 track to J1 pin 10 1 mm wide where it fits, 0.8 mm from other copper."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 144.78 132.08 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(color 200 60 0 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "0dbfddbe-f9d7-5988-a172-8a89b75b7fe6")
	)
	(text_box "PARTS AND THEIR JOBS\nU902: SN74AHCT1G125 single buffer on +5V: its input accepts 3.3 V logic, its output swings to 5 V. Pin 1 (OE, active low) to GND = always enabled.\nR905: 100k pull-down: keeps DOUT1 off while the ESP32 starts or resets (GPIO23 floats then).\nC904: 100 nF decoupling for U902 VCC (pin 5).\nU903: BSP75N self-protected low-side switch (SOT-223): 0.5 A continuous, 0.52 Ohm on, current limit 0.7-1.5 A, thermal shutdown with automatic restart, 60-75 V clamp so relay coils need no flyback diode.\nDOUT1_IN: Net label: the 5 V drive from U902 to U903 IN."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 156 0)
		(size 155 20.4)
		(margins 1.5 1.5 1.5 1.5)
		(stroke
			(width 0.1524)
			(type solid)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "0e90f75c-0407-57be-bb95-8ebef3972a00")
	)
